Story: First throw
  As a new pilot
  I want to throw the plane by opening the throttle, like at the field
  So that launching in the sim feels like the real thing

  Scenario: Throttle up, then pick it back up
    When the throttle is 80 %
    Then the aircraft is flying
    When the throttle is 0 %
    And the pilot presses reset
    Then the aircraft is in hand

Story: Calibrating a new radio
  As a pilot with a new radio
  I want to calibrate it with the plane in my hand
  So that sweeping the sticks during setup doesn't throw the plane

  Scenario: Sweep the throttle in the wizard, then fly
    When the pilot presses calibrate
    Then the calibration wizard is open
    When the throttle is 100 %
    Then the aircraft is in hand
    When the throttle is 0 %
    And the pilot presses calibrate
    Then the calibration wizard is closed
    When the throttle is 80 %
    Then the aircraft is flying

Story: Picking a flight mode
  As a pilot learning to fly
  I want to choose how much the plane helps me before I throw it
  So that I can start out in self-levelling ANGLE mode

  Scenario: Step to ANGLE and throw
    When the pilot presses flight mode
    Then the flight mode is ANGLE
    When the pilot presses launch
    Then the aircraft is flying
